-- נספח א'1 — טבלת השכר למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101), מעודכנת החל מיום 1.9.2016: the first-degree (BA)
-- salary table of the reform from 1.9.2016, as the corpus publishes it.
-- It is annex א'1 of the September 2016 agreement (30.9.2016), whose §5(א)
-- makes annexes א'1–א'7 the combined-salary tables from that day and which
-- the corpus holds without its annexes: the agreement takes each cell as a
-- named input (imported). The page says so under the table: "טבלאות שכר
-- מהסכם 30092016 שהמשיכו בהסכם 19032017" — the tables of the agreement of
-- 30.9.2016, continued by its amendment of 19.3.2017.
--
-- What the agreement says of them, checked here over every cell: they
-- replace the tables in force on 31.8.2016 (the tables of 1.1.2015,
-- imported) and pay less than those only to a teacher in grades 6.5–9
-- (§5(ב)(1)(א), who gets the salary-protection supplement Z); so every
-- cell to grade 6 is the cell of 1.1.2015, and every cell from grade 7
-- below it. The table prints its steps — 7.5% to every grade, where the
-- tables of 1.1.2015 rose 8.5% to grades 7–9 — and the cells are checked
-- against them. The tables of the agreement of 22.2.2016, also "from
-- 1.9.2016" and set aside by §9 of the September agreement, are imported
-- to show the two are not the same tables.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2015-01-01_ofek-hadash_salary-tables_morim`
IMPORT `2016-09-30_ofek-hadash_september-2016-agreement`

§ `נספח א'1 — טבלת השכר למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101), 1.9.2016`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח א'1"; the table below is that annex.

